cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or its build pipeline, please cite it as follows."
title: "Tampa Published Development Records: Source-Bounded Longitudinal Tracker"
type: dataset
version: 0.9.0
date-released: 2026-08-28
authors:
  - family-names: Lenga
    given-names: Jack
abstract: >-
  A reproducible archive of every feature returned by eight named City of
  Tampa ArcGIS layers at recorded snapshot times, with deterministic monthly
  change detection, explicit source-universe definitions, and count
  reconciliation. The first release is a baseline; completeness applies only
  to the named published core-layer snapshots, not to all permits, real-world
  development, parcels, completions, or investment.
keywords:
  - Tampa
  - urban development
  - open data
  - building permits
  - capital projects
  - bounded census
  - longitudinal data
  - reproducible research
